{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790707943652,"sessionID":"ses_f117d708affeghrZ43p7nR0Pzo","part":{"id":"prt_0ee82c131001V1ufHzpUptrTfM","messageID":"msg_0ee82b955001RHCYUTxeP7KEyF","sessionID":"ses_f117d708affeghrZ43p7nR0Pzo","type":"reasoning","text":"Now let me look at the agent.py fight2 and the exploration logic.\n\nKey insight from data: 9/15 seeds never leave dlvl 1, dying to low-level monsters. The milestone is `BE_ON_FIRST_LEVEL` -> condition is `experience_level >= 8`, target level is (DUNGEONS_OF_DOOM, 1). Wait — so the milestone's level is dlvl 1 and condition is XL 8. Hmm, `go_to_level_strategy(*level, ...)` with level=(DUNGEONS_OF_DOOM, 1). So it tries to get to dlvl 1, which it starts on. Let's look at what that does.\n\nLet me check agent.py.","time":{"start":1790707941681,"end":1790707943649}}}
